    "created_at": "2016-01-12T15:35:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-12T15:35:17Z",
    "body": "TextEvent already behaves similar too. Gecko supports TextEvents; but nobody else does. Of course TextEvent isn't part of the current spec and is deprecated; but nonetheless there are other examples of things Gecko supports that Safari, Edge, and Blink based browsers don't support.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
