    "created_at": "2016-01-12T16:06:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-12T16:06:21Z",
    "body": "Gecko used to have only keyevents, and keyboardevent was added in \nhttps://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=238773, so, long ago.\nIn mozilla-central there are several tests using \"keyevents\", so I guess would need to fix those and then add some telemetry and based on that say something here.\n",
